## Image and 3D Model Attributions

This project bundles third-party imagery and 3D models in `static/images/cars/`,
`static/images/source/`, and `static/models/`. Each file retains the license
under which it was originally distributed.

### Car hero photographs (`static/images/cars/`)
Photographs in `static/images/cars/` are sourced from Wikimedia Commons under
various Creative Commons licenses (CC-BY, CC-BY-SA, CC0, etc.). For full
attribution of each image, see the corresponding Wikipedia article:

